From 9bb281b01bb60b58bcaaba7cb0ec057ad3aa25de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Agent <codex-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:56:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Preserve decoded image profiles and PNG precision in Skia
 storage

Retain RGB ICC samples in the shared backing store and construct Skia images from their actual storage, profile and alpha representation. Convert unsupported Skia profiles through unpremultiplied float XYZ with alpha kept separate. Preserve meaningful PNG16 precision through interlace and APNG storage operations. Existing other-codec precision limits and non-Skia paths remain explicit.

Source implementation only; native compilation and focused regressions are pending coordinator admission.
